## What I found

Almost every open item on the board needs something this sandbox can't reach — no `gh`, no `ssh`, no GCP. But there's an **untracked `error.log` at the repo root** (gitignored via `*.log`) holding the tail of a real `deploy-cloud-run.yml` run:

```
ERROR: (gcloud.auth.docker-helper) ... 'Unable to acquire impersonated credentials',
