All citations (`payments.module.ts:56`, `auth.controller.ts:153`, `notifications.module.ts:15`/`:21`, `prometheus.yml:47`/`:49`, `alerts.yml:184`, `.gitignore:24`, `apps/api/package.json:103`), both merge columns, the 38-commit window, sweeps (TODO 0; citations 1,039/1,037/571), all refs, and (C)'s two halves.

**CLAUDE.md needs no edit** — I checked its two parallel claims and both are already accurate: line 2334 says only "they hold the versions they were cut at" (true, no staleness claim), and line 2497 already names 10.0.1 rather than the major.

